名稱中英對照表</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<ul class=\"thlex-index-list\">\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">acacia</span>　金合歡<ul>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">common</span>　普通金合歡</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">umbrella thorn</span>　傘刺金合歡</li>\n</ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">agarwood</span>　沉香樹、沉香木</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">almond</span>　杏樹、杏仁樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">aloe</span>　沉香、蘆薈</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">aloeswood (agarwood)</span>　沉香樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">Amboyna wood</span>　血木</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">anemone</span>　銀蓮花<ul>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">crown</span>　冠狀銀蓮花</li>\n</ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">anise</span>　八角茴香</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">apple</span>　蘋果<ul>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">bitter</span>　藥西瓜</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">crab</span>　酸蘋果</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">love</span>　愛情果</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">wild</span>　野蘋果</li>\n</ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">apricot</span>　杏李</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">aromatic cane (calamus)</span>　香菖蒲</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">ash</span>　白蠟樹<ul>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">Syrian</span>　敘利亞白蠟樹</li>\n</ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">aspen</span>　山楊</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">balm</span>　香膏</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">balsam (opobalsumum)</span>　香脂（麥加香脂）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">barley</span>　大麥</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">barwood (sandalwood)</span>　非洲紫檀</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">bay tree (laurel)</span>　月桂樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">beans</span>　蠶豆</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">bitter aloe</span>　苦蘆薈</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">bitter herbs</span>　苦菜</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">bitter