\">citrus</span>　柑橘樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">clove</span>　丁香</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">coastal juniper (Phoenician juniper)</span>　沿海杜松（腓尼基杜松）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">colocynth (wild gourd)</span>　柯羅辛（野瓜）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">coriander</span>　芫荽</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">cotton</span>　棉花<ul>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">Levant</span>　黎凡特棉</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">tree</span>　樹棉</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">upland</span>　海島棉</li>\n</ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">crocus</span>　番紅花</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">cucumber</span>　黃瓜</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">cumin (cummim)</span>　孜然</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">cypress</span>　柏樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">daffodil (narcissus)</span>　黄水仙花（水仙花）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">darnel (weed)</span>　毒麥（雜草）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">date palm</span>　海棗</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">dill</span>　蒔蘿</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">dog’s club</span>　狗棍</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">dove’s dung</span>　鴿子糞</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">durra (sorghum)</span>　硬稈高粱（高粱）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">eaglewood (agarwood)</span>　鷹木（沉香木）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">eastern savin</span>　東方檜柏</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">ebony</span>　烏木</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">Asian</span>　亞洲烏木</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">egusi (wild gourd)</span>　苦西瓜（野瓜）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">elm</span>　榆樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">emmer wheat</span>　二粒小麥</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">eryngo</span>　刺芹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">eucalyptus</span>　桉樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">fennel</span>　小茴香</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">fenugreek</span>　葫蘆巴</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">fig</span>　無花果<ul>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">common</span>　普通無花果</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">mulberry</span>　桑樹無花果</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">sycomore</span>　西克莫無花果</li>\n</ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">fir</span>　杉樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">fitches</span>　雞鼬</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">flag</span>　水菖蒲</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">flagroot (calamus)</span>　蒲根（香菖蒲）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">flax</span>　亞麻</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">flowers</span>　花</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">frankincense</span>　乳香</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">galbanum (fennel)</span>　白松香（小茴香）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">gall (poison hemlock)</span>　毒參</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">garlic</span>　蒜</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">ginger grass (calamus)</span>　薑草（香菖蒲）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">gofer (cypress)</span>　柏樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">goodly tree</span>　美好樹</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">gorse</span>　金雀花</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">grain</span>　穀物</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">grape (vine)</span>　葡萄（葡萄樹）</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">grass</span>　草</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">camel</span>　駱駝草</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">darnel</span>　毒麥</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">ginger</span>　薑草</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">lemon</span>　檸檬草</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">mosquito</span>　蚊草</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">gum tragacanth</span>　黄蓍膠</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">hammada</span>　梭梭</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">harrow</span>　芒柄花</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">henbane</span>　天仙子</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">henna</span>　散沫花</li>\n<li><span class=\"thlex-index-key\">holly